    "Description": "*********** People's Alliance ***********\n******/ 'Stronger When United' /******\n\nRE: Scan, Mine, and Prospector Payout\n\nWORK BRIEF: \nStill pulling together data on mining and mineral extraction but got a special payout for this one. Once <EM4>you scan ~mission(Resources)</EM4> and relay your stats back to us, I'll get you something real nice for all your help. ~mission(Rarity)\n\nBy this point you know what you're doing but just going to remind you that <EM4>the United Resource Workers' mining journal on your mobi is great if you're stuck.</EM4>\n\nLet me know if you\u2019re up for it.\n\nPAYMENT:\nGot a special MISC Prospector as payment for all your help.\n\nAUTHORIZATION:\nBattaglia, Recco",
