    "DisplayDescription": "*********** People's Alliance ***********\n******/ 'Stronger When United' /******\n\nRE: Scan, Mine, and Prospector Payout\n\nWORK BRIEF: \nStill pulling together data on mining and mineral extraction but got a special payout for this one. Once <EM4>you scan [AmountToScan] of Savrillium, [AmountToScan2] of Lindinium and [AmountToScan3] of Bexalite</EM4> and relay your stats back to us, I'll get you something real nice for all your help. These are pretty rare resources, so they might be tricky to find.\n\nBy this point you know what you're doing but just going to remind you that <EM4>the United Resource Workers' mining journal on your mobi is great if you're stuck.</EM4>\n\nLet me know if you\u2019re up for it.\n\nPAYMENT:\nGot a special MISC Prospector as payment for all your help.\n\nAUTHORIZATION:\nBattaglia, Recco",
